OL,3,GNEWSAOff-duty officer injured by
OL,4,Asuspected drink-driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn off-duty police officer suffered
OL,7,Fserious facial injuries when he was
OL,8,Fattacked while trying to detain a
OL,9,Fsuspected drink-driver.
OL,11,FThe officer approached the man in
OL,12,FNewland Avenue, Hull, at 22:30 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday and attempted to detain him as
OL,14,Fhe waited for on-duty colleagues to
OL,15,Fattend, Humberside Police said.
OL,17,FThe man, who appeared to be drunk,
OL,18,Fallegedly became aggressive and
OL,19,Fassaulted the off-duty officer.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
