OL,3,GNEWSAOff-duty officer injured by
OL,4,Asuspected drink-driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of assaulting an emergency
OL,8,Fworker and wounding with intent. He
OL,9,Ffailed a roadside breath test and
OL,10,Fremained in custody on Wednesday.
